# Database

- MariaDB is the only primary DB; Prisma `provider = "mysql"`
- Never introduce PostgreSQL, `pg`, or `pgvector`
- All schema changes via Prisma migrations in `@agency/database`
- Never manually alter production schema
- Customer-owned rows carry `organizationId`; index tenant + list filters
- Transactions for financial and other critical operations
- Money as integer minor units; unique constraints on provider external IDs where needed
- Soft delete (`deletedAt`) for CRM/content unless erasure requires hard delete
- Embeddings/RAG chunks stay in MariaDB (`VectorStore` adapter) — see `docs/DATABASE.md`
